NonStop=0
Jump 2,@ClickL ON,227,,-1
Jump 0,@CtrlKey ON;AutoMode OFF,226,SKIP,13
Calc 2,winerase OFF,ﾃｷｽﾄ終了変数 = ﾃｷｽﾄ終了変数 + 1
Calc 0,,ﾃｷｽﾄ終了変数 = ﾃｷｽﾄ終了変数 % 4
Jump 0,ﾃｷｽﾄ終了変数 < 3,226,,-1
Calc 2,,ﾃｷｽﾄ終了変数 = 0
IncFrame 0,,7
Calc 2,AutoMode ON,AutoModeCount = AutoModeCount + 1
Jump 0,AutoMode ON;AutoModeCount >= AutoSpeed,227,,-1
Calc 2,@NoTextWait OFF,スキップ中 = OFF
Load 0,@NoTextWait OFF,VOL2,@Vol2,67
